# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
#
# The trailing * is load-bearing, not tidiness: an exact-match `key.properties`
# leaves `key.properties.bak` / `.old` / `.orig` untracked-but-visible, and a
# file holding live signing passwords is exactly the file someone backs up
# before editing. That happened during R0 — a `.bak` made while fixing the
# storeFile path showed up in `git status` and had to be caught by eye.
key.properties*
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
